#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, glCrashedWarning)
#: compositing.ui:262
msgid ""
"OpenGL compositing (the default) has crashed KWin in the past.\n"
"This was most likely due to a driver bug.\n"
"If you think that you have meanwhile upgraded to a stable driver,\n"
"you can reset this protection but be aware that this might result in an "
"immediate crash!\n"
"Alternatively, you might want to use the XRender backend instead."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, interfaceWarning)
#: compositing.ui:278
msgid ""
"EGL is not supported by all OpenGL drivers. If not supported the Compositor "
"will be disabled."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, scaleWarning)
#: compositing.ui:294
msgid ""
"Scale method \"Accurate\" is not supported by all hardware and can cause "
"performance regressions and rendering artifacts."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, windowThumbnailWarning)
#: compositing.ui:323
msgid ""
"Keeping the window thumbnail always interferes with the minimized state of "
"windows. This can result in windows not suspending their work when minimized."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (KMessageWidget, unredirectInformation)
#: compositing.ui:339
msgid ""
"Having full screen windows bypass the compositor is not supported on every "
"hardware."
msgstr ""

#: main.cpp:82
msgid "Re-enable OpenGL detection"
msgstr "Aktifkan ulang deteksi OpenGL"

#: main.cpp:139
msgid ""
"\"Only when cheap\" only prevents tearing for full screen changes like a "
"video."
msgstr ""
"\"Hanya jika murah\" hanya mencegah perobekan untuk perubahan layar penuh "
"seperti video."

#: main.cpp:143
msgid "\"Full screen repaints\" can cause performance problems."
msgstr "\"Gambar ulang layar penuh\" dapat menyebabkan masalah performa."

#: main.cpp:147
msgid ""
"\"Re-use screen content\" causes performance severe problems on MESA drivers."
msgstr ""
"\"Daur ulang isi layar\" menyebabkan masalah serius performa pada penggerak "
"MESA."

